    {
      "key": "lean-proof-package",
      "definition": {
        "name": "Lean Proof Package",
        "purpose": "Source contract for packages/lean-proofs, checked against Git-managed files using the local Anatomy CLI. Separate Core, Theories, handwritten Recipes, generic CatalogCases, Generated certificates, DataContracts and Verification. Recipe directories compose the reusable Lean Recipe Unit. verification/ and bridge/ hold schemas, proof scope, provenance and frontend action correspondence. Build/dependency caches are excluded by Git. This contract checks filesystem shape only; check-lean-contracts checks import layers, declared targets, allowed axioms and action-plan equality.",
