      "key": "lean-recipe-unit",
      "definition": {
        "name": "Lean Recipe Unit",
        "purpose": "Handwritten Lean recipe directory with PascalCase name, required Model.lean, Spec.lean and Proofs.lean, plus optional nonempty Lemmas/. Model defines recipe state and transitions; Spec defines named propositions; Proofs proves them. Directory checks do not establish file contents or runtime equivalence.",
